WEBVTT

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.502
You've been caught
red-handed for smuggling.

00:00:06.631 --> 00:00:08.174
The goods will be confiscated,

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.884
and you will be
taken into custody.

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:15.765
What was that?

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:17.934
Looks like some trouble.

00:00:18.476 --> 00:00:20.103
I'm gonna check it out!

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:21.855
Hey!

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:37.328
I'm gonna lend a hand!

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.919
There's no need for that!

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:49.716
You should learn to accept
the generosity of others.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.926
What you're offering is called

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:54.095
an unwelcome favor.

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:57.223
You're not cute.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.851
I'd prefer you didn't
think that I'm cute.

00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:13.990
I'm not letting you get away!

00:01:15.784 --> 00:01:18.578
If they're in a car, there're
only certain routes they can take.

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:20.538
We can catch up by
using the back roads!

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:24.000
Wh-What?

00:01:24.709 --> 00:01:25.752
Hurry up.

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:27.629
I know!

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.050
There's some
trouble at the harbor.

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:33.009
Trouble?

00:01:33.468 --> 00:01:34.344
Here you go.

00:01:36.054 --> 00:01:37.722
Lasagna!

00:01:38.014 --> 00:01:39.933
I've been waiting for you!

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:42.102
Thank you for the meal!

00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:43.353
Hey!

00:01:51.986 --> 00:01:53.279
Milady.

00:01:53.905 --> 00:01:55.949
What is it now, Luca?

00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:01.913
Th-The party tonight
is a very special one.

00:02:01.913 --> 00:02:04.040
We should start heading
back to the mansion.

00:02:04.707 --> 00:02:08.044
There'll be plenty of time,
even after we finish our patrol.

00:02:09.212 --> 00:02:10.505
Yes, but...

00:02:10.505 --> 00:02:12.924
You'll also need time to change.

00:02:19.347 --> 00:02:21.224
Found you!

00:02:22.559 --> 00:02:23.810
Libertá?

00:02:25.186 --> 00:02:26.604
That idiot.

00:02:26.604 --> 00:02:28.022
He's too reckless.

00:02:28.273 --> 00:02:29.357
Nova.

00:02:30.275 --> 00:02:31.484
Felicitá.

00:02:36.614 --> 00:02:39.075
Don't move, Libertá.

00:02:40.743 --> 00:02:41.536
Debito!

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:50.295
Jump, Libertá!

00:02:51.045 --> 00:02:52.255
Are you serious?!

00:02:55.925 --> 00:02:57.635
That's dangerous, Dante!

00:02:57.635 --> 00:02:59.053
No need to worry.

00:03:02.056 --> 00:03:02.932
See?

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:04.601
Pace.

00:03:06.102 --> 00:03:07.228
Move!

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:28.625
I-I surrender.

00:03:31.794 --> 00:03:34.130
And that settles that.

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:35.423
Dante,

00:03:35.423 --> 00:03:38.301
what are we going
to do about the car?

00:03:41.262 --> 00:03:42.972
I was about to die!

00:03:42.972 --> 00:03:44.724
Your actions are too bold!

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:47.685
Well, I am bald.

00:03:47.685 --> 00:03:49.395
Just kidding!

00:03:50.313 --> 00:03:51.898
Let's go.

00:03:55.401 --> 00:03:57.570
Who are those people?

00:03:57.946 --> 00:03:59.614
That was intense.

00:03:59.614 --> 00:04:02.575
Is this your first
time here, boys?

00:04:03.701 --> 00:04:06.704
I'm curious if this
is the first time

00:04:06.704 --> 00:04:09.040
you've been to the
trade island of Regalo.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:10.875
Y-Yes.

00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:12.585
Then let me tell you.

00:04:13.211 --> 00:04:16.005
Clean out your
ears and listen well.

00:04:16.005 --> 00:04:19.968
They are the vigilante organization
that protects Regalo Island,

00:04:21.052 --> 00:04:22.971
the Arcana Famiglia.

00:05:59.233 --> 00:06:00.860
Milady.

00:06:01.861 --> 00:06:04.614
What did you just say?

00:06:04.614 --> 00:06:06.449
You mustn't.

00:06:06.449 --> 00:06:09.243
This isn't just
some ordinary party.

00:06:12.121 --> 00:06:13.122
Milady.

00:06:14.665 --> 00:06:16.584
Everyone is waiting for you.

00:06:21.589 --> 00:06:23.466
Milady!

00:06:23.466 --> 00:06:24.801
What's the matter, Luca?

00:06:25.218 --> 00:06:28.221
You're not attending the
party in those clothes, are you?

00:06:28.304 --> 00:06:28.596
Yeah.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.600
You mustn't!

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:33.267
Today is—

00:06:33.267 --> 00:06:35.478
Papa's birthday, right?

00:06:35.478 --> 00:06:37.105
Let's go, Fukulota.

00:06:39.941 --> 00:06:42.902
She used to be
much more obedient.

00:06:43.403 --> 00:06:46.447
Maybe there's a problem
with how you raised her.

00:06:46.447 --> 00:06:47.115
Huh?

00:06:47.115 --> 00:06:51.119
Indeed, you were her
attendant since she was little.

00:06:51.119 --> 00:06:51.786
Huh?

00:06:51.786 --> 00:06:53.955
It's all your fault, Luca.

00:06:53.955 --> 00:06:54.622
Huh?!

00:06:54.622 --> 00:06:56.874
We're going to be late, Luca!

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.461
Right away, Milady!

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:11.764
What's wrong?

00:07:13.349 --> 00:07:16.269
What are you wearing, Bambina?

00:07:16.602 --> 00:07:20.731
We were all looking forward
to seeing you in a dress.

00:07:21.399 --> 00:07:23.317
What's wrong with
what I'm wearing?

00:07:23.317 --> 00:07:26.571
Luca, do your job
as her attendant!

00:07:26.571 --> 00:07:29.866
Yeah! It's bad enough that we're
constantly surrounded by just guys!

00:07:29.866 --> 00:07:31.242
But I...

00:07:31.242 --> 00:07:33.911
But I wanted her
to wear a dress, too!

00:07:33.911 --> 00:07:35.037
However,

00:07:35.496 --> 00:07:37.457
if something were to
happen, it's probably better

00:07:37.457 --> 00:07:40.293
for her to be wearing something
less restrictive than a dress.

00:07:41.836 --> 00:07:43.129
You've got a point.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:47.508
It's easier to admire
Bambina's long, beautiful legs

00:07:47.508 --> 00:07:50.136
with what she's got on now.

00:07:50.136 --> 00:07:53.014
Do you have a
leg fetish, shorty?

00:07:54.056 --> 00:07:56.225
We may agree on something.

00:07:56.893 --> 00:07:58.227
How stupid.

00:08:09.655 --> 00:08:10.364
Huh?

00:08:11.574 --> 00:08:13.659
You're not wearing
a dress, Princess?

00:08:22.126 --> 00:08:23.586
What's wrong?

00:08:23.586 --> 00:08:24.754
Princess?

00:08:24.754 --> 00:08:25.755
Your face is red.

00:08:31.719 --> 00:08:33.262
Ouch.

00:08:34.096 --> 00:08:36.724
What the hell was that for?

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:41.312
Wh-What the hell
did I do, Princess?!

00:08:44.232 --> 00:08:45.316
Jolly.

00:08:45.316 --> 00:08:48.444
It's because you were
thinking bad things.

00:08:48.945 --> 00:08:51.280
What do you mean, "bad things?"

00:08:51.531 --> 00:08:56.077
This shouldn't need
explaining again, but we have all

00:08:56.077 --> 00:09:01.249
made a deal with Tarocco
to gain our Arcana powers.

00:09:01.249 --> 00:09:03.209
For example, you, Libertá,

00:09:03.209 --> 00:09:08.881
have the first card,
Il Matto: the Fool.

00:09:09.423 --> 00:09:10.841
R-Right.

00:09:11.259 --> 00:09:20.560
Nova, just like you have the
13th card, La Morte: Death.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:22.728
You don't have to
explain all of this now.

00:09:23.563 --> 00:09:28.609
Milady made a deal
with the sixth card,

00:09:28.609 --> 00:09:32.071
Gli Amanti: the Lovers.

00:09:33.364 --> 00:09:38.286
Her power, by that I
mean her Arcana power,

00:09:38.286 --> 00:09:41.831
is the power to see
into others' hearts.

00:09:42.331 --> 00:09:43.499
Then...

00:09:48.504 --> 00:09:51.090
But I just saw it by chance.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:56.721
Yes. Arcana powers use
emotions as their foundation.

00:09:57.638 --> 00:10:01.475
The reason you don't have
control over your powers yet, Milady,

00:10:02.393 --> 00:10:04.562
is because you're
still just a child.

00:10:06.188 --> 00:10:08.149
Please do not touch the lady.

00:10:16.866 --> 00:10:19.785
She read Libertá's heart?

00:10:20.411 --> 00:10:26.917
Does that mean you were thinking of Milady in unbecoming
ways?! Idiot The hell do you mean, "unbecoming ways?!"

00:10:27.209 --> 00:10:29.754
W-Well...

00:10:35.801 --> 00:10:38.512
My apologies, Milady...

00:10:38.512 --> 00:10:40.431
My condolences.

00:10:40.431 --> 00:10:41.724
Hey!

00:10:41.724 --> 00:10:44.185
Dante's going to
give his greeting.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:47.313
Gentlemen,

00:10:47.313 --> 00:10:48.856
I would like to thank everyone

00:10:48.856 --> 00:10:51.400
for showing up despite
your busy schedules,

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:54.695
for the sake of our Arcana
Famiglia's "Papa," Mondo.

00:10:55.154 --> 00:10:57.782
We would like to start
with a word from Papa.

00:11:00.618 --> 00:11:02.244
The head of our family!

00:11:02.244 --> 00:11:03.704
Glory to Arcana!

00:11:03.704 --> 00:11:04.872
Gentlemen.

00:11:04.872 --> 00:11:07.041
Thank you for gathering today.

00:11:07.708 --> 00:11:10.711
I am celebrating my
59th birthday today.

00:11:11.295 --> 00:11:14.799
The reason I have gotten
this far is because of all of you.

00:11:16.592 --> 00:11:18.427
Our Regalo Island

00:11:18.427 --> 00:11:20.596
has overcome many hardships.

00:11:21.222 --> 00:11:24.767
Raids from smugglers,
occupation from foreign countries,

00:11:24.767 --> 00:11:26.560
lack of goods,

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:29.438
oppression from a
tyrant, epidemics...

00:11:30.147 --> 00:11:32.775
Once you start
counting, there's no end.

00:11:32.775 --> 00:11:36.195
But we were able to overcome
all of this with our familial bond,

00:11:36.195 --> 00:11:40.449
and with the Arcana powers.

00:11:41.575 --> 00:11:44.620
But I've gotten to that age.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:46.914
I'm starting to think
about retirement.

00:11:49.041 --> 00:11:50.251
Papa?

00:11:50.501 --> 00:11:51.919
Therefore,

00:11:51.919 --> 00:11:55.631
I am considering choosing
someone to take my place.

00:11:58.801 --> 00:12:02.304
In two months, we will be
holding the Arcana Duello.

00:12:03.472 --> 00:12:05.766
Arcana Duello?

00:12:06.851 --> 00:12:10.312
It will be a fight where all those
with Arcana powers will participate

00:12:10.312 --> 00:12:14.108
to determine who has the
strongest Arcana powers.

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:21.991
I, the 21st card, Il Mondo:
The World, hereby swear

00:12:23.117 --> 00:12:26.454
to give the victor
the title of "Papa"

00:12:27.079 --> 00:12:29.248
and grant their wish.

00:12:31.208 --> 00:12:33.335
One more thing.

00:12:34.712 --> 00:12:38.215
The winner will marry
my daughter, Felicitá.

00:12:55.316 --> 00:12:56.817
Marry the Princess?

00:12:56.817 --> 00:12:59.028
What are you thinking, Papa?

00:12:59.945 --> 00:13:03.073
What? What does that mean?

00:13:03.073 --> 00:13:04.992
Well, this will get interesting.

00:13:14.585 --> 00:13:16.587
What is it, Felicitá?

00:13:17.254 --> 00:13:19.507
Do you have any concerns?

00:13:20.132 --> 00:13:23.093
I don't want to get married.

00:13:23.594 --> 00:13:28.057
You chose with your own free
will to join the Arcana Famiglia.

00:13:28.057 --> 00:13:30.726
This is the rule of the family.

00:13:30.726 --> 00:13:34.605
Meaning, you
have to do as I say.

00:13:35.773 --> 00:13:37.316
Am I wrong?

00:13:39.902 --> 00:13:44.782
You will become the new
Mama, and support the family.

00:13:45.574 --> 00:13:47.535
What's the reason
for this, Papa?

00:13:48.369 --> 00:13:50.037
There is a reason.

00:13:50.037 --> 00:13:53.290
However, I need
not explain myself.

00:13:55.584 --> 00:13:56.710
Oh?

00:13:58.045 --> 00:14:00.548
If you don't want
to follow orders,

00:14:00.548 --> 00:14:02.758
challenge me here and win.

00:14:02.758 --> 00:14:03.634
Papa!

00:14:03.634 --> 00:14:04.677
That's impossible!

00:14:04.677 --> 00:14:06.345
Just shut up.

00:14:07.721 --> 00:14:09.348
This looks interesting.

00:14:15.396 --> 00:14:18.232
Is that all your
kick has to offer?

00:14:25.823 --> 00:14:27.032
Princess...

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.035
I will choose...

00:14:30.035 --> 00:14:31.704
my own path!

00:14:32.788 --> 00:14:35.583
You haven't the right to
choose your own path...

00:14:37.084 --> 00:14:39.211
in your present condition!

00:14:43.841 --> 00:14:44.842
Princess!

00:14:44.842 --> 00:14:45.759
Milady!

00:14:52.474 --> 00:14:55.102
If you're just going
to sit there and glare,

00:14:55.102 --> 00:14:56.604
a little child can do that, too.

00:14:58.022 --> 00:15:02.067
Why not try shedding
a tear or two, as well?

00:15:02.902 --> 00:15:05.362
You may be able to
earn the pity of the men

00:15:05.362 --> 00:15:07.823
who are going to participate
in the Arcana Duello.

00:15:11.452 --> 00:15:15.289
You're robbing the
Princess of her freedom.

00:15:16.874 --> 00:15:19.501
How can you call
yourself a father?!

00:15:19.877 --> 00:15:22.254
What are you doing, Libertá?

00:15:22.671 --> 00:15:25.382
Well done, Libertá the fool!

00:15:25.382 --> 00:15:27.885
Your careless, no regard
outbursts are fantastic!

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:30.930
Don't instigate him, Debito!

00:15:31.805 --> 00:15:35.184
Are you saying you can't
follow orders either, Libertá?

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:37.144
That's right!

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:42.024
Then defeat me,
right here, right now.

00:15:42.775 --> 00:15:44.693
What's the matter?

00:15:44.693 --> 00:15:48.572
Are you scared of making a
fool of yourself, like Felicitá?

00:15:49.823 --> 00:15:52.952
There's no guarantee...

00:15:56.497 --> 00:15:58.374
that I'm going to
make a fool of myself!

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:02.044
Libertá!

00:16:06.632 --> 00:16:07.800
Nova!

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:11.470
Papa is the father
of our family, as well.

00:16:12.304 --> 00:16:14.431
I won't condone any harm

00:16:15.349 --> 00:16:16.934
toward our father.

00:16:20.729 --> 00:16:21.981
Move!

00:16:31.657 --> 00:16:32.574
Debito?

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:35.077
Very perceptive.

00:16:35.869 --> 00:16:42.084
I made a deal with the ninth
card, L'eremita: the Hermit.

00:16:42.918 --> 00:16:46.880
So your powers are to
make yourself invisible.

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:48.215
Let me go!

00:16:48.215 --> 00:16:49.425
Let go of me!

00:16:50.884 --> 00:16:53.512
Would you let me
go, you meathead!

00:16:53.512 --> 00:16:55.139
I understand how you feel, but

00:16:55.139 --> 00:16:57.808
it's not good if
you disobey Papa.

00:16:59.059 --> 00:17:00.519
Pace has

00:17:00.519 --> 00:17:06.025
a deal with the 11th
card, La Forza: Strength.

00:17:06.567 --> 00:17:08.485
His strength is overwhelming.

00:17:08.485 --> 00:17:10.946
No one can oppose it.

00:17:12.698 --> 00:17:13.615
Let go.

00:17:14.616 --> 00:17:15.951
Let me go!

00:17:16.994 --> 00:17:18.078
What?

00:17:26.045 --> 00:17:27.463
How pitiful.

00:17:29.673 --> 00:17:32.509
If you want to free my daughter,

00:17:32.509 --> 00:17:34.887
then you need to
win the Arcana Duello.

00:17:36.263 --> 00:17:37.765
I told you.

00:17:40.934 --> 00:17:44.104
I will grant any wish.

00:17:47.232 --> 00:17:49.068
Felicitá.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:52.529
Mama.

00:17:52.988 --> 00:17:55.449
There is a way for
you to win as well.

00:17:57.034 --> 00:17:58.952
You're going to choose

00:17:59.369 --> 00:18:01.413
your own path, right?

00:18:10.089 --> 00:18:14.134
The Wheel of Fortune
has started turning,

00:18:15.344 --> 00:18:18.972
opposing the guidance
of the Tarocco.

00:18:21.141 --> 00:18:24.603
There's no way I'd get married,

00:18:24.603 --> 00:18:28.565
but I wouldn't mind being
bound with Bambina.

00:18:28.857 --> 00:18:30.859
Debito, how dare you?!

00:18:32.152 --> 00:18:37.825
I'm sure every day would be
fun if the Princess were my wife.

00:18:38.325 --> 00:18:40.702
Pace, you, too?

00:18:41.328 --> 00:18:44.915
Then what are you going to do
about the Arcana Duello, Luca?

00:18:44.915 --> 00:18:47.668
I will cheer on Milady!

00:18:47.668 --> 00:18:50.379
However, Papa said,

00:18:51.004 --> 00:18:55.008
that everyone with Arcana
powers will be fighting.

00:18:57.594 --> 00:19:00.472
Bambina is a heartless woman.

00:19:01.181 --> 00:19:05.978
However, that can
be rather charming.

00:19:06.979 --> 00:19:11.358
Mondo has thought up
something rather absurd.

00:19:11.358 --> 00:19:17.739
I'm getting all excited
thinking of Milady as my bride.

00:19:18.198 --> 00:19:20.409
Jolly, you...

00:19:20.409 --> 00:19:23.829
What? Do you think I'll lose?

00:19:24.872 --> 00:19:27.833
Unfortunately, that's
not going to happen.

00:19:27.833 --> 00:19:31.378
That is, if I take
this seriously.

00:19:39.678 --> 00:19:41.013
Libertá.

00:19:42.014 --> 00:19:43.891
Don't worry, Princess!

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:45.309
What?

00:19:45.976 --> 00:19:48.854
I'm going to win this and
take the title of "Papa."

00:19:49.438 --> 00:19:50.898
Then...

00:19:50.898 --> 00:19:53.817
I'll be your bride?

00:19:56.069 --> 00:19:57.863
No!

00:19:57.863 --> 00:19:59.489
Th-That's not what I meant!

00:19:59.489 --> 00:20:01.533
Um...

00:20:02.159 --> 00:20:06.538
Anyway, it means you'll
regain your freedom.

00:20:06.538 --> 00:20:07.497
Right?

00:20:10.876 --> 00:20:12.461
That's right.

00:20:13.045 --> 00:20:16.590
You may end up my bride...

00:20:17.925 --> 00:20:21.011
But that's sort of
weird to think about.

00:20:22.554 --> 00:20:23.931
You're so oblivious.

00:20:24.723 --> 00:20:27.601
What do you mean by
"oblivious," you chickpea.

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:30.270
Don't call me a chickpea!

00:20:31.104 --> 00:20:34.441
You can barely control
your Arcana powers,

00:20:34.441 --> 00:20:37.110
yet you're foolish enough to
say you'll win the Arcana Duello.

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:39.238
If that's not oblivious,
then what is it?

00:20:41.698 --> 00:20:45.494
I made the decision
to live by this sword.

00:20:47.621 --> 00:20:50.499
So I have no need
for Arcana powers.

00:20:52.793 --> 00:20:55.128
You truly are oblivious.

00:20:55.128 --> 00:20:59.633
But you can't use your
Arcana powers either.

00:21:01.051 --> 00:21:05.472
I've never seen you
use your Arcana powers.

00:21:05.472 --> 00:21:07.474
Don't compare me with you!

00:21:12.271 --> 00:21:14.398
Don't worry, Felicitá.

00:21:16.483 --> 00:21:23.031
If I were to win, I'll
wish not to marry you.

00:21:26.201 --> 00:21:30.372
That means if either of us wins,

00:21:30.372 --> 00:21:32.624
then Princess will be free!

00:21:32.624 --> 00:21:36.712
The likelihood of you
winning is rather slim.

00:21:37.587 --> 00:21:39.756
The hell did you
say, you chickpea?!

00:21:39.756 --> 00:21:41.091
The truth.

00:21:42.467 --> 00:21:44.553
And don't call me a chickpea.

00:23:30.867 --> 00:23:32.994
Ciao! So, next time's story
involves Princess and me

00:23:32.994 --> 00:23:34.579
looking for the
owner of a lost cat?

00:23:34.579 --> 00:23:36.623
It should be a lot of fun since
it's just me and the Princess...

00:23:36.623 --> 00:23:39.418
What? The chickpea's
coming, too? Ugh...